○インプレッションでいくらですみたいな感じで媒体資料が作られますので。\n一応、読み完了までを早くする効果もあると思いますけど、それはあくまで副次的効果な気がしますね。","ts":"1624509261.376300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4VROH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D6DE3D46-F537-4A61-9A6F-7B45DEC8A78C","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"長すぎる脚注はコラムにするべきですね。区切りが分かりにくくなるので。本文中か、ページ下部かは問題ではないと思う。","ts":"1624509073.372700","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1624509094.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pcU7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"34ea4a36-0633-4ffe-8190-a3072a79f19b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。広告の営業資料か。","ts":"1624509061.372300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XXmq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"C2665297-43B8-4218-8DC4-9FD48DA368B9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まぁ広告営業資料にはなりますよね","ts":"1624509033.371500","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1624509051.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hz9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cca681de-c844-4884-ad24-c5e460b65366","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"PVを稼ぐとどうなるんですかね？広告収益が上がる？","ts":"1624509007.370100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jc5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"FA690CD2-576B-4BE1-9652-1502C60FCE0F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"分割はPV稼ぎかな","ts":"1624508967.368700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nh6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e261996a-0e67-4258-a14f-7f8c3040567b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ただし、「注釈の範囲がどこからどこまでか」は分かりにくいなと感じました。注釈の終わりと本文の始まりの境目。スマホから読んでるからかも？\n注釈が一目で本文と区別できるなら問題ないですね","ts":"1624508908.368200","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR",